{"sample_id": 4, "prompt": "Conduct effective product control and valuation control of treasury products and derivatives in banking book.\nDut", "reference": "ies include daily P&L reporting and analysis, balance sheet substantiation, pricing parameter verification and market conformity checking.\nFirst point of contact for front office to handle ad hoc queries on position, P&L.\nUniversity graduate with degree in Financial Engineering, Quantitative Finance, Risk Management, Finance, Economics, Accounting or related disciplines. Further professional qualification such as ACCA, CPA, CFA, FRM would be a plus.\nAt least 2 year of working experience in equity and interest rate related treasury products and/or product control, solid experience in South East Asia is an advantage.\nProficiency in financial instruments & market operations.", "generated_dual_stream": "ies and responsibilities of the product control manager in banking.\nAccounting and valuation of the product control manager in banking.\nStuart Bluestock, the product control manager in banking.\nZimbabwe Bank of the product control manager in banking. How does it", "generated_original": "ies may include but are not limited to the following:\nReviewing and approving treasury products and derivatives for compliance with market practice and internal treasury policy, in accordance with the risk appetite of the bank and the risk management framework.\nAssisting in the preparation of", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.17391304347826086, "rouge2": 0.014705882352941176, "rougeL": 0.15942028985507245, "rougeLsum": 0.13043478260869565}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.37777777777777777, 0.022727272727272728, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.18887560283756186, "length_ratio": 0.375, "translation_length": 45, "reference_length": 120}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8405832052230835, "bert_score_recall": 0.798407256603241, "bert_score_f1": 0.8189526200294495}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.25174