{"sample_id": 56, "prompt": "Shri Lal Mahal is one of the best manufacturer, exporter and supplier of empire basmat", "reference": "i rice in Delhi, India. We provide world class best quality rice.\nAnother advantage of Empire Basmati Rice is that its consumption is not restricted in people with certain medical conditions, unlike other potential vehicles such as sugar (restricted in people with diabetes) and fish sauce, fish paste, and salt (restricted in people with renal disorders and hypertension). As it contains minimal, rather negligible sugar, it is fit and healthy to be consumed by all age groups. Since it is easily digestible, even after consuming this rice you still feel light and yet energetic.\nEmpire Rice will work with you for every meal you plan. From simple and delicious dishes to sweet puddings, the possibilities are endless!!", "generated_dual_stream": ", and has been doing this for the past 10 years. It has been used by the best chefs and has been widely known for its high quality basmat. The palace is located in the city of Jaipur and the best result is given by", "generated_original": "i rice in India. Our company has been in the business of the manufacturing and supplying of the best quality Basmati Rice. The empire basmati rice is one of the best quality basmati rice available in the market. We have the", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.18633540372670804, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.08695652173913043, "rougeLsum": 0.12422360248447205}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3617021276595745, 0.021739130434782608, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.14735750808299128, "length_ratio": 0.34306569343065696, "translation_length": 47, "reference_length": 137}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8453733325004578, "bert_score_recall": 0.8128393292427063, "bert_score_f1": 0.8287871479988098}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.22784810126582278, "rouge2": 0.07692307692307693, "rougeL": 0.16455696202531644, "rougeLsum": 0.18987341772151897}, "ble