{"sample_id": 60, "prompt": "Select a year for genuine Kia Sportage accessories.\nWe've been providing genuine Kia accessories and parts", "reference": " online at low prices since 2000. Our genuine Kia Sportage accessories are affordably shipped directly from an authorized Kia dealer at discounted prices. Our extensive inventory covers every Kia model and every genuine Kia accessory available from Kia. We offer secure Kia Sportage accessories online ordering and expedient shipping. All our genuine Kia Sportage accessories and Kia Sportage parts are backed by Kia's warranty, which is covered by any Kia dealer in the US. Contact our expert customer service team for help finding any genuine Kia Sportage accessories or performance parts that you don't see in our catalog.", "generated_dual_stream": "since 2009. Our products are backed by a popular director of service who is an authorized dealer of the Kia Sportage. If you are looking for a substitute dealer or parts for Kia accessories, please contact us. We proudly serve the North Shore", "generated_original": "for 10 years.\nWe are the number one online retailer of genuine Kia Sportage accessories and genuine Kia Sportage parts.\nAt Parts4Parts we sell genuine Kia Sportage accessories and genuine Kia Sportage parts.\nAt Parts4Parts we sell genuine", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.3356643356643356, "rouge2": 0.05673758865248227, "rougeL": 0.18181818181818182, "rougeLsum": 0.18181818181818182}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.5531914893617021, 0.13043478260869565, 0.022222222222222223, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.2911133545301908, "length_ratio": 0.44761904761904764, "translation_length": 47, "reference_length": 105}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8789399862289429, "bert_score_recall": 0.8600678443908691, "bert_score_f1": 0.8694015145301819}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.36231884057971014, "rouge2": 0.17647058823529413, "rougeL": 0.2608695652173913, "rougeLsum": 0.20289855072463772}, "bleu