eeded South Africa and frastructure provision the emergg Waterber. more.", "generated_dual_stream": "In South Africa, Wholesale Various High Quality Stone Crusher in South Africa, Wholesale Various High Quality Stone Crusher in South Africa. Stone Crusher In South Africa, Wholesale Various High Quality Stone Crusher in South Africa, Wholesale Various High Quality Stone Crusher in South Africa,", "generated_original": "In South Africa Products from Global Stone Crusher In South Africa Suppliers and Stone Crusher In South Africa Factory,Importer,Exporter at Alibaba.\nstone crusher in south africa for sale - Crusher South Africa. stone crusher in south africa for sale... 2016 stone", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.16763005780346824, "rouge2": 0.11046511627906977, "rougeL": 0.16763005780346824, "rougeLsum": 0.16184971098265896}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0003830841589942991, "precisions": [0.56, 0.2857142857142857, 0.125, 0.0425531914893617], "brevity_penalty": 0.0022428677194858034, "length_ratio": 0.14084507042253522, "translation_length": 50, "reference_length": 355}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8309346437454224, "bert_score_recall": 0.7600427865982056, "bert_score_f1": 0.7939093112945557}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.2209302325581395, "rouge2": 0.1754385964912281, "rougeL": 0.2209302325581395, "rougeLsum": 0.2209302325581395}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0013953557606073174, "precisions": [0.9, 0.6530612244897959, 0.5208333333333334, 0.48936170212765956], "brevity_penalty": 0.0022428677194858034, "length_ratio": 0.14084507042253522, "translation_length": 50, "reference_length": 355}, "bert_score_precision": 0.905459463596344, "bert_score_recall": 0.7743507623672485, "bert_score_f1": 0.8347885608673096}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 2.57684588432312}
