{"sample_id": 209, "prompt": "Are You Bone to Craft?\nThe Skull Craft Social is turning five, and this time we're", "reference": " headed to La Boca to see whose sugar skull will take home the crown. We provide the appetizers, papier-m\u00e2ch\u00e9 skulls, paint, glitter and more. You bring your appetite, your vision, and any special embellishments you want to get ahead of the competition. Prizes will be awarded to crowd favorites, and you'll take home your masterpiece with plenty of time to enjoy before Halloween. Full menu and extended Happy Hour deals are available to order, as well.\nNeed some inspiration? Check out the photos from last year.\nThis event has historically sold out, so use your head and register now!", "generated_dual_stream": "getting custom-made. This is a perfect blend of the best craft beers at the best price. We're delighted to announce that prices for Individual and Family of any age or skill level. You can also guarantee your visit to us for a minimum of", "generated_original": "throwing a huge birthday bash! All you have to do is create a craft that you'd like to see on the Skull Craft Social page, and you'll be entered to win a prize!\nThe deadline for submissions is 6:00pm, July", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.16216216216216217, "rouge2": 0.013698630136986302, "rougeL": 0.09459459459459461, "rougeLsum": 0.12162162162162164}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2978723404255319, 0.06521739130434782, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.23532011256478041, "length_ratio": 0.40869565217391307, "translation_length": 47, "reference_length": 115}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8332127332687378, "bert_score_recall": 0.8169438242912292, "bert_score_f1": 0.824998140335083}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.17931034482758618, "rouge2": 0.04195804195804196, "rougeL": 0.12413793103448278, "rougeLsum": 0.13793103448275862}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2608695652173913, 0.06666666666666667, 0.022727272727272728, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.22313016014842982, "length_ratio": 0.4, "translation_length": 46, "reference_length": 115}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8421787023544312, "bert_score_recall": 0.8269522190093994, "bert_score_f1": 0.8344959616661072}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 3.066788673400879}
{"sample_id": 210, "prompt": "Congratulations and thanks to Maen for his hard work over the past year. The fruit of his", "reference": " labor (his original manuscript) is now in press at Journal of Biological Chemistry. Which no matter how you slice it, is a pretty good journal. The manuscript describes the results from heroic numbers of biochemical experiments, purifications and assays to show that a 'calcium sensor' molecule called calmodulin binds to the cardiac sodium channel. This feat is all the more impressive when one considers that Maen along with the Van Petegem crew started the project by setting up the biochemistry in the newly founded lab. Thanks to Dr. Van Petegem for the expert assistance, advice and encouragement. Here's to many, many more.\nProst! Go Maen & The Ahern Lab!", "generated_dual_stream": "work is now available for viewing each day.\nThe trees are very imposing. The nuts are very dense. The fruit of his work is now available for viewing in the new year. The trees are very imposing. The nuts are very dense. The fruit", "generated_original": "efforts will be the new Maen website that goes live this week.\nThe main goal of the new site is to make it easier to find what you are looking for. This is particularly important to Maen and the other developers at the Maen farm", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.18300653594771243, "rouge2": 0.02649006622516556, "rougeL": 0.13071895424836602, "rougeLsum": 0.13071895424836602}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.32, 0.061224489795918366, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.22763768838381274, "length_ratio": 0.4032258064516129, "translation_length": 50, "reference_length": 124}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8418997526168823, "bert_score_recall": 0.7931727170944214, "bert_score_f1": 0.8168101906776428}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.25974025974025977, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.14285714285714288, "rougeLsum": 0.16883116883116883}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.46808510638297873, 0.043478260869565216, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.19431050224901314, "length_ratio": 0.3790322580645161, "translation_length": 47, "reference_length": 124}, "bert_score_precision": 0.849398136138916, "bert_score_recall": 0.8107386827468872, "bert_score_f1": 0.8296182751655579}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 3.0637755393981934}
{"sample_id": 211, "prompt": "Industrial-chic IceTray Direct delivers new levels of lighting quality from a direct luminaire.\n", "reference": "Available with either a perforated side shied or an opal diffuser in three compelling forms \u2013 angular, rectangular and curved \u2013 these throwback luminaires look nostalgic but perform to Peerless\u2019 state-of-the-art standards.\nIdeal for commercial offices, retail environments and, of course, schools, IceTray Direct earns high marks in both Art and Economics.", "generated_dual_stream": "We aim to create a custom light fixture for your home or business. Whatever the size of your home lighting needs.\nIceTray Direct emits a light fixture that is ideal for all types of lighting needs. Whether you prefer a light fixture for your home", "generated_original": "The IceTray Direct is an innovative, direct luminaire that delivers a new level of lighting quality to your space.\nThe IceTray Direct features an innovative LED light engine that delivers a crisp, bright and uniform light output. The light engine is", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.20408163265306123, "rouge2": 0.04166666666666667, "rougeL": 0.12244897959183673, "rougeLsum": 0.12244897959183673}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.1875, 0.02127659574468085, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.7951959897951258, "length_ratio": 0.8135593220338984, "translation_length": 48, "reference_length": 59}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8489977121353149, "bert_score_recall": 0.8249905109405518, "bert_score_f1": 0.836821973323822}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1702127659574468, "rouge2": 0.021739130434782608, "rougeL": 0.1276595744680851, "rougeLsum": 0.1276595744680851}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.24444444444444444, 0.022727272727272728, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.7326324677392158, "length_ratio": 0.7627118644067796, "translation_length": 45, "reference_length": 59}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8612068891525269, "bert_score_recall": 0.8