{"sample_id": 221, "prompt": "Iseult \\i-seu-lt\\ as a girl's name is a variant of", "reference": " Isolde. See for origin and meaning of Iseult.\nThe baby name Iseult sounds like Yseult, Yseulte and Isolt. Other similar baby names are Iseut, Esyllt, Isla, Isolte and Isold.", "generated_dual_stream": "the name of a girl who means \"she lies in her bed\".\nThe name is an English translation of the name of the girl who means \"she lies in her bed\". The name is an English translation for the name of the girl who means \"", "generated_original": "Iseult (Irish, English, Gaelic): feminine form of Iseult.\nThe baby name Iseult sounds like Isla, Ise, Iseu, Iseul, Iselle, Iseulie, Is", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1081081081081081, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.08108108108108109, "rougeLsum": 0.1081081081081081}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.11538461538461539, 0.0196078431372549, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 1.0, "length_ratio": 1.4054054054054055, "translation_length": 52, "reference_length": 37}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8205625414848328, "bert_score_recall": 0.7891833782196045, "bert_score_f1": 0.8045670986175537}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.36000000000000004, "rouge2": 0.2916666666666667, "rougeL": 0.36000000000000004, "rougeLsum": 0.36000000000000004}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.24000842489987545, "precisions": [0.42424242424242425, 0.28125, 0.22580645161290322, 0.2], "brevity_penalty": 0.8858460329277067, "length_ratio": 0.8918918918918919, "translation_length": 33, "reference_length": 37}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8949085474014282, "bert_score_recall": 0.8914886713027954, "bert_score_f1": 0.8931953310966492}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 1.421844244003296}
