{"sample_id": 237, "prompt": "Joseph Prince is savvy about the errors of the prosperity gospel and antinomianism, and", "reference": " he even makes unambiguous statements denouncing them; nevertheless, he still continues to teach the same errors only under a different light.... You are a blessed servant of God, Pastor Joseph Prince. I watch you on TV, how you teach on the walk of faith and how God loves and cares for us. Now reading this\u2026is simply awesome! You teach the word in the simplest of ways so that all that listens can understand and desire to follow the Lord. God bless you Sir. May He bless your home and ministry continually in Jesus name. Amen.\nWhen you become conscious of Him, His love for you and all that He has done for you at the cross, you will want to place Him in the centre of your life. So start looking to Jesus. Start focusing on His beauty. Start enjoying His love. That\u2019s how you will live a life worth living!... Amudombi has 6 books on Goodreads, and recently added Your Miracle Is In Your Mouth by Joseph Prince.\nAnd as you see a gracious God in the midst of an imperfect people, and the love of Christ in His perfect sacrifice, faith will spring up in your heart to speak His Word and receive your miracle. Official links & \u2026... 11/10/2018 \u00b7 Prince William's Paternity Leave Comes to an End as Carole Middleton Gets Ready to Plan Your Next Family Party!\n6/10/2007 \u00b7 Know in your heart and declare with your mouth that it is going to be a good week, during which you will see God\u2019s preservation, wholeness, health and prosperity. When you have that kind of attitude, you are actually putting on your \u201cHelment of Salvation\u201d.", "generated_dual_stream": "through all the years has been one of the most influential theologians in the history of the gospel. His works is still informed by his many years of experience and is still relevant, but the truth is, the only one that can be found on the", "generated_original": "yet he is also savvy enough to know that what matters most is the heart. He is wise enough to know that the heart of the believer must be right before God. The heart must be surrendered, and the heart must be transformed.\nIn the book", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.15805471124620063, "rouge2": 0.012232415902140673, "rougeL": 0.09726443768996959, "rougeLsum": 0.1276595744680851}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.5306122448979592, 0.041666666666666664, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.0034359240209329324, "length_ratio": 0.14984709480122324, "translation_length": 49, "reference_length": 327}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8259122371673584, "bert_score_recall": 0.7918193936347961, "bert_score_f1": 0.8085066080093384}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1398176291793313, "rouge2": 0.012232415902140673, "rougeL": 0.08510638297872339, "rougeLsum": 0.12158054711246201}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.46, 0.04081632653061224, 0.020833333333333332, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.003926526838305624, "length_ratio": 0.1529051987767584, "translation_length": 50, "reference_length": 327}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8443034887313843, "bert_score_recall": 0.8006724119186401, "bert_score_f1": 0.8219093084335327}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 3.0351147651672363}
{"sample_id": 238, "prompt": "ST. PAUL, Minn. (AP) \u2014 Groups advocating for Minnesota's Latino community", "reference": " are at the state Capitol to highlight issues affecting immigrants.\nRoughly 150 people gathered in the rotunda Monday and were led in a chant of, \"No ban, no wall. Sanctuary for all.\"\nSpeakers addressed many issues ranging from the education gap to affordable health insurance.\nAdvocates also highlighted the importance of creating a Real ID law that would allow immigrants living in the country illegally to get driver's licenses. They also stressed the importance of continuing the Deferred Action for Childhood Arrivals program, which protects those brought to the country illegally as children.", "generated_dual_stream": "will be out of state lawmakers' sights, and they will have to be their own. The groups will be able to vote at least once per month in Minnesota and are required to vote against each other when it comes to their opposition party. The Minnesota", "generated_original": "will work with Minnesota officials to bring a measure on state ballot that would ban the state from using English only for purposes of government.\nThe measure, known as the English Only for Government Act, would bar state agencies from using English for all communication. Instead", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.18571428571428572, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.11428571428571427, "rougeLsum": 0.09999999999999999}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2653061224489796, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.32548171969825196, "length_ratio": 0.47115384615384615, "translation_length": 49, "reference_length": 104}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8356021046638489, "bert_score_recall": 0.8076695799827576, "bert_score_f1": 0.8213984370231628}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.2142857142857143, "rouge2": 0.043478260869565216, "rougeL": 0.11428571428571427, "rougeLsum": 0.18571428571428572}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.36, 0.061224489795918