{"sample_id": 277, "prompt": "TamarinTech receives a BQ Ciclop scanner!\nThe BQ Ciclop scanner is now", "reference": " available at the LulzBot(tm) website for purchase Ciclop 3D Scanner Kit (BQ). Stay tuned as we try out this new 3D scanner kit.\nYou can learn more from BQ and check out the Horus scanning software on github.\nWebsite content at TamarinTech is provided by Tamarin Technology LLC and is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License unless otherwise indicated.", "generated_dual_stream": "available in one of the most prestigious black businesses and organizations in Tanzania. The scanner is owned by the company's sole proprietor, and is the first time that a company has received a BQ for over 2 years. The scanner will be used to", "generated_original": "integrated in TamarinTech\u2019s software to enable our customers to scan documents and create PDF files with a few clicks.\nThe Ciclop scanner is an entry level scanner that can be used to scan documents in various formats such as PDF, TIFF, JPEG,", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.23636363636363636, "rouge2": 0.018518518518518517, "rougeL": 0.16363636363636366, "rougeLsum": 0.20000000000000004}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2978723404255319, 0.021739130434782608, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.6001124060641446, "length_ratio": 0.6619718309859155, "translation_length": 47, "reference_length": 71}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8334193229675293, "bert_score_recall": 0.7838521003723145, "bert_score_f1": 0.8078761696815491}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.20370370370370372, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.09259259259259259, "rougeLsum": 0.16666666666666669}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.1956521739130435, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.5807248229785978, "length_ratio": 0.647887323943662, "translation_length": 46, "reference_length": 71}, "bert_score_precision": 0.849651575088501, "bert_score_recall": 0.8112089037895203, "bert_sc