{"sample_id": 351, "prompt": "NEW YORK, NY\u2014Local man Ricky Quintana has taken criticism for what some call his \u201c", "reference": "archaic\u201d and \u201coutdated\u201d beliefs.\nWho is the state? Citizens. Sovereign persons who institute the state through their sovereign personhood for the reasons inscribed in The Preamble, the purpose of our Constitution. The state is subservient to the people.\nFascism comes along with a statist substitute for religion. When they say \u201cEverything in the State, it includes their substitute religion from which we obedient subjects are to derive our morality and motivation.\nToday\u2019s Democratic Party offers a Neo-Druidism which worships trees and practices human sacrifice.", "generated_dual_stream": "grandmother\u201d and \u201cgrandfather\u201d for allegedly taking advantage of an older woman\u2019s heart.\nQ: What is it called when a man meets up with a woman right? What is the man\u2019s relationship with a woman based on the information that he", "generated_original": "inappropriate\u201d decision to be naked in his car while driving. Quintana, a self-proclaimed \u201ccar guy\u201d and a licensed mechanic, has been in the news for his naked drive for more than 24 hours. He was spotted in his", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.203125, "rouge2": 0.031746031746031744, "rougeL": 0.14062500000000003, "rougeLsum": 0.15625}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3023255813953488, 0.047619047619047616, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.3054263799328471, "length_ratio": 0.4574468085106383, "translation_length": 43, "reference_length": 94}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8417381048202515, "bert_score_recall": 0.8210378289222717, "bert_score_f1": 0.8312590718269348}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.144, "rouge2": 0.016260162601626015, "rougeL": 0.08, "rougeLsum": 0.128}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.30952380952380953, 0.024390243902439025, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.2899359512667195, "lengt