{"sample_id": 382, "prompt": "The pretty village of Hutton-le-Hole is home to one of the North York Moors", "reference": "' most popular visitor attractions; the Ryedale Folk Museum.\nHere in an idyllic village setting dozens of historic buildings from around Ryedale have been brought together and carefully reassembled. The Folk Museum helps preserve a way of life typical of Ryedale for centuries. It really is one of England's most outstanding museums.\nThis photo is a traditional village store, of the type that would have been found in most villages across Ryedale until quite recently. The store was brought here from its original home in Rosedale.", "generated_dual_stream": "National Park\u2019s longest running lakes. The lakeside has a fabulous cycling and the village has a pleasant atmosphere. Hutton-le-Hole offers make-up and other beauty and wellness to your business. The village is situated in the Conservative Party, so you", "generated_original": "' most important and well-loved attractions, the Yorkshire Dales National Park Visitor Centre and the Hutton-le-Hole Waterfalls.\nThe visitor centre is open from Easter to October. There is a shop with local produce, local guides and a cafe", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.186046511627907, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.10852713178294575, "rougeLsum": 0.15503875968992248}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3488372093023256, 0.047619047619047616, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.3054263799328471, "length_ratio": 0.4574468085106383, "translation_length": 43, "reference_length": 94}, "bert_score_precision": 0.835541307926178, "bert_score_recall": 0.8262174129486084, "bert_score_f1": 0.8308532238006592}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1904761904761905, "rouge2": 0.03225806451612903, "rougeL": 0.12698412698412698, "rougeLsum": 0.15873015873015872}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.38095238095238093, 0.07317073170731707, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.2899359512667195, "length_ratio": 0.4