{"sample_id": 432, "prompt": "Your little princess will be the Belle of the ball in this beautiful yellow gown.\nWith unique details", "reference": " throughout this beautiful yellow gown is perfect for next Hallowe'en and for dress-up time. She'll love the fun and playful bows and tulle that make this dress a beautiful and fun addition to her play time.\nSeveral layers of yellow tulle make it fluffy and fun.\nTop bib is a yellow gold sequinned fabric.\nYellow satin ribbon creates the shoulder straps.\nAdorned with a beautiful yellow rose at the waist.\nHeadpiece has a combination of red roses and yellow roses on a red headband.\nAll of our tutu dresses are created with 100's of yards of tulle, but your princess will need under garments for full coverage.", "generated_dual_stream": ", this exquisite dress is suitable for any occasion and is perfect for giving birth. Designed for those looking for an unforgettable evening, this dress is a perfect choice for a princess. With its stylish and unique details, this dress is the perfect way for any", "generated_original": ", this Belle of the Ball dress will be the talk of the ballroom.\nBeautifully designed with a full skirt and a lovely lace front, this dress will make your little princess look stunning.\nBelle of the Ball is sure to be a hit", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.21794871794871795, "rouge2": 0.05194805194805195, "rougeL": 0.15384615384615385, "rougeLsum": 0.20512820512820512}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.36, 0.08163265306122448, 0.020833333333333332, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.2671353019658503, "length_ratio": 0.43103448275862066, "translation_length": 50, "reference_length": 116}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8772719502449036, "bert_score_recall": 0.8263411521911621, "bert_score_f1": 0.8510453104972839}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.2857142857142857, "rouge2": 0.026315789473684206, "rougeL": 0.14285714285714285, "rougeLsum": 0.22077922077922074}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "pr