{"sample_id": 445, "prompt": "The Second Annual \u201cBlack History: Artists\u2019 Perspectives\u201d exhibition opens at Hayti with a reception", "reference": " on Friday, February 3, 2017. The exhibition is sponsored by Mechanics & Farmers Bank and the North Carolina Mutual Life Insurance Company.\nNew and returning artists will participate in this year\u2019s exhibition, organized by Durham artist Willie Bigelow. The reception is open to the public. Refreshments and live entertainment will be featured.\nContact info@hayti.org for additional information.", "generated_dual_stream": "on Thursday, November 20, 2020. Explore the exhibition in conjunction with the 2020 edition of Hayti\u2019s Black History Month and the 2020 edition of the Hayti Historical Preservation Survey. Explore the exhibition in conjunction with the", "generated_original": "on Saturday, March 6 from 1:00pm to 4:00pm. Curated by Professor Marissa B. McPherson, the exhibit features 16 works by 14 artists from the Hayti neighborhood, highlighting the cultural", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.22916666666666669, "rouge2": 0.0425531914893617, "rougeL": 0.16666666666666669, "rougeLsum": 0.20833333333333334}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.275, 0.02564102564102564, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.4723665527410147, "length_ratio": 0.5714285714285714, "translation_length": 40, "reference_length": 70}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8595729470252991, "bert_score_recall": 0.8418070077896118, "bert_score_f1": 0.8505972027778625}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.20000000000000004, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.13333333333333336, "rougeLsum": 0.15555555555555556}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3157894736842105, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.4308026151974351, "length_ratio": 0.5428571428571428, "translation_length": 38, "reference_length": 70}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8430872559547424, "bert_score_recall": 0.8481146097183228, "bert_score_f1": 0.8455933928489685}, "ori