{"sample_id": 471, "prompt": "Scheduling your trip, pay attention to Sydney Jewish Museum and remember to choose where to eat:", "reference": " this restaurant is right aside the mentioned attraction. If you have never tasted Spanish cuisine, you should reserve a table at Almond Bar. This place serves good grilled calamari, duck and lamb skewers. You will find tasty ice cream, baklava and g\u00e2teau on the menu.\nThe wine list is extensive, every visitor can find something that satisfies their taste. Great coffee is served at this spot. The nice staff works hard, stays positive and makes this place great. The fabulous service is a big benefit of this restaurant. Fair prices are what you are to pay for your meal. At Almond Bar, people can enjoy the charming atmosphere and divine decor. This place has a Zomato rating of 4.1 and leaves a positive aftertaste on guests.\nCute little restaurant in Darlo serving great food. We ordered falafel, tabouleh and haloumi, and a bottle of red. Owner is lovely and very attentive.\nFood is always good l, great ambient. Would be better if the place is a bit bigger.\nSyrian Restaurant located in Darlinghurst. We had the Meza plate and perfectly prepared calamari. Be sure to make a reservation as the place is popular.", "generated_dual_stream": "Gourmet and cuisine, and emphasis on Jewish cuisine. Bring over to the conference table where you can enjoy the hot watermelon and fresh zucchini. The Jewish Museum of Sydney, which was established in 1962, is situated on the waterfront from", "generated_original": "you are in Sydney Australia.\nSydney Jewish Museum is a place with a wide range of exhibitions and other cultural events. Sydney Jewish Museum is located in the heart of Sydney, on the corner of Oxford Street and Anzac Parade, opposite the Sydney Jewish", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.15319148936170213, "rouge2": 0.02575107296137339, "rougeL": 0.11063829787234043, "rougeLsum": 0.12765957446808512}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.5111111111111111, 0.13636363636363635, 0.023255813953488372, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.020018246204381345, "length_ratio": 0.20361990950226244, "translation_length": 45, "reference_length": 221}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8446460366249084, "bert_score_recall": 0.8062704205513, "bert_score_f1": 0.82501220703125}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1589958158995816, "rouge2": 0.03375527426160337, "rougeL": 0.1087866108786611, "rougeLsum": 0.15062761506276154}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.4791666666666667, 0.0851063829787234, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.027210110459771984, "length_ratio": 0.2171945701357466, "translation_length": 48, "reference_length": 221}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8249596357345581, "bert_score_recall": 0.7907421588897705, "bert_score_f1": 0.8074885606765747}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 3.11316180229187}
{"sample_id": 472, "prompt": "A Butterick 3952\u2026 Dress in Two Lengths Sewing Pattern in Size 12", "reference": ". The pattern is uncut and complete. The instructions are there. The envelope is in excellent vintage condition with tanning and wear. The envelope flap is still attached. There is no copyright date but following the guide this pattern is 1965. This pattern was designed by Glamour Magazine for Butterick and includes the original one page insert (a section of the insert is shown in the second picture). There are fabric tips, dressmaking tips, suggestions on what to do with your hair, and ideas for scarves, handbags, gloves, shoes, bras, jewelry and hats. This pattern can make \u201c88 versions of this perfect pattern!\u201d Pattern Description \u201cA-shaped one or two-piece dress with wide jewel neckline and princess seaming. With or without contrast panels, belt or neck insets. Optional top-stitch trim.\u201d Size 12: 32\u201d, 25\u201d, 34\u201d All patterns are vintage items and sold\u2026AS IS. Although I maintain a smoke-free and a pet-free studio, I have no control over where items have been previously. I attempt to represent my goods as honestly as possible, but sometimes something will get by. If you have any doubts about an item, E-MAIL ME! I want to make sure that you will be pleased with your purchase. I will make a refund as merchandise credit; buyer pays for return shipments. Pattern comes in a zip 2 mil. plastic bag and is shipped in an envelope with a cardboard insert. The zip bag is great for storing the pattern! Please note that I count the pattern pieces unless factory folded, assess the pattern\u2019s condition and press the pattern as necessary. You will never purchase a pattern from me with \u201cIt looks like it\u2019s all there\u201d or \u2018Pieces need pressing\u2019.", "generated_dual_stream": "in Fashion. Designed and engineered to know how to make the best of your works!\nA Butterick 3952\u2026 Dress in Two Lengths Sewing Pattern in Size 12 in Fashion. Designed and engineered to know how to make the best of", "generated_original": ". This pattern is a 1950\u2019s style dress and includes the following features: A long, full skirt with a 5 inch waistband and a yoke at the front and back. The skirt has a 3 inch front dart and is", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.14589665653495437, "rouge2": 0.012232415902140671, "rougeL": 0.0911854103343465, "rougeLsum": 0.0972644376899696}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.5348837209302325, 0.047619047619047616, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.0014518978432686155, "length_ratio": 0.13271604938271606, "translation_length": 43, "reference_length": 324}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8179377913475037, "bert_score_recall": 0.7834420800209045, "bert_score_f1": 0.8003184199333191}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1276595744680851, "rouge2": 0.04281345565749235, "rougeL": 0.0911854103343465, "rougeLsum": 0.0911854103343465}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.5348837209302325, 0.21428571428571427, 0.04878048780487805, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.0014518978432686155, "length_ratio": 0.13271604938271606, "translation_length": 43, "reference_length": 324}, "bert_score_precision": 0.84748774766922, "bert_score_recall": 0.7934145927429199, "bert_score_f1": 0.8195602297782898}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 3.258918046951294}
{"sample_id": 473, "prompt": "For my senior capstone project, I chose to develop a branding for an invented company. I", "reference": " imagined a winery to brand, and produced a custom, hand-done logo and bottle labelling system. I included the items that would come along with a subscription box for the winery\u2019s wines. The initial box includes a selection of wines, a wine tasting book, wine glass markers, and coasters all created within the Riserva brand.", "generated_dual_stream": "chose a company that I was born in and raised by one of the most influential adults in its history, the company is called the \u201cattractive African company\u201d. I chose a company that was not only grew up in its history but also its culture.", "generated_original": "chose the name, \u201cMagnetism,\u201d and the logo is a magnetic field that represents the core values and philosophy of the company. My concept is that the company is a magnet that pulls in the most creative minds, and the logo is the magnetic", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1782178217821782, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.11881188118811882, "rougeLsum": 0.11881188118811882}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.25, 0.02127659574468085, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.7470175003104325, "length_ratio": 0.7741935483870968, "translation_length": 48, "reference_length": 62}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8259182572364807, "bert_score_recall": 0.8159514665603638, "bert_score_f1": 0.820904552936554}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.24242424242424243, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.18181818181818182, "rougeLsum": 0.18181818181818182}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3125, 0.02127659574468085, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.7470175003104325, "length_ratio": 0.7741935483870968, "translation_length": 48, "reference_length": 62}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8426721692085266, "bert_score_recall": 0.8314189910888672, "bert_score_f1": 0.8370077610015869}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 3.31269693374