{"sample_id": 490, "prompt": "The process of making DIY studded shorts is pretty easy, if you don\u2019t mind getting your", "reference": " freshly manicured nails broken and your nail polish chipped. I didn\u2019t anyways.\nStep 2// Stud the hell out of them! Arrange the studs in the pattern of your choice, I chose a pretty simple one as you can see.\nEt voila, your DIY studded shorts are done in no time!\nPS. You can buy studs in your local craft stores, online or, as I\u2019ve been told, even in some pet shops!\n11 THOUGHTS ON \"DIY studded shorts\"\nwow,moram i ja probam!\nHey, I linked this post in my blog.\nOmg!! i love this Great job!!\nThese are awesome. Just did a post about DIYing boyfriend shorts and referenced these. So excited to try this!\nwhere do you get studs?", "generated_dual_stream": "hands dirty or sewing skills are slightly high. Below is a simple tutorial on how to make DIY studded shorts. You can download the material or use paper to get your hands dirty.\nYou can download the material or use the following video to get your", "generated_original": "hands dirty. You can make your own studded shorts with the help of a few materials and a few tools.\nI\u2019ve made a few studded shorts in the past, but I decided to go for a more DIY approach and make my own st", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.2261904761904762, "rouge2": 0.04819277108433735, "rougeL": 0.13095238095238096, "rougeLsum": 0.20238095238095238}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.40816326530612246, 0.08333333333333333, 0.0425531914893617, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.13260133104084862, "length_ratio": 0.3310810810810811, "translation_length": 49, "reference_length": 148}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8495637774467468, "bert_score_recall": 0.8125927448272705, "bert_score_f1": 0.8306670188903809}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.25149700598802394, "rouge2": 0.06060606060606061, "rougeL": 0.155688622754491, "rougeLsum": 0.22754491017964074}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, 