{"sample_id": 518, "prompt": "Do I need to enter my complete address?\nWe strongly encourage you to enter your actual street address", "reference": ", city, state, ZIP/Postal Code and Country if you reside in the United States. If you reside outside of the U.S., enter your street address, Province/Region, ZIP/Postal Code and Country. This information is used if an additional form of identification is required when you sign in to the product. If you are required to go through an additional level of authentication upon future log in and have an international address, you will be limited to using your telephone as the means for identification; questionnaires are not created for international addresses.", "generated_dual_stream": ".\nWe do not receive direct mail, so please do not enter your true address to ensure that we are not sending you mail.\nWhat should I do when entering my address?\nI have been using the same address for the last 5 years. I", "generated_original": ", as this is the address which will be displayed on your certificate.\nPlease also note that your street address is used in the delivery process (for example, for tracking purposes) and therefore cannot be altered.\nWe will only use your email address for our", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.2043795620437956, "rouge2": 0.02962962962962963, "rougeL": 0.13138686131386862, "rougeLsum": 0.1751824817518248}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3673469387755102, 0.041666666666666664, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.28797029135520824, "length_ratio": 0.44545454545454544, "translation_length": 49, "reference_length": 110}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8344157934188843, "bert_score_recall": 0.8090720772743225, "bert_score_f1": 0.8215485215187073}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.26277372262773724, "rouge2": 0.07407407407407407, "rougeL": 0.1751824817518248, "rougeLsum": 0.218978102189781}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.42, 0.10204081632653061, 0.020833333333333332, 0.0], "br