{"sample_id": 534, "prompt": "Hello everyone! How are you? I was busy with home renovation that I wasn't able to", "reference": " regularly post on this blog. I have time to write now, so I'll share with you about out new love.\nWelcome, Karlee Pet! She's our new dog. She will be with us from now on, with Enzo, of course.", "generated_dual_stream": "perform and share my blog at the same time. So, I've got my blog back! I'm so sorry you guys were missing out!\nI can be found in the 4th floor of the cathedral. I'm the 14th floor", "generated_original": "post my previous post! Anyway, we have a new apartment! It's so beautiful! We got an apartment in a new residential area in the west of Singapore. The area is called Clementi and it's very near to Jurong West MRT", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.24390243902439024, "rouge2": 0.025000000000000005, "rougeL": 0.1951219512195122, "rougeLsum": 0.21951219512195122}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3023255813953488, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.8902267532558452, "length_ratio": 0.8958333333333334, "translation_length": 43, "reference_length": 48}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8528782725334167, "bert_score_recall": 0.8572519421577454, "bert_score_f1": 0.8550595045089722}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1927710843373494, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.14457831325301207, "rougeLsum": 0.16867469879518074}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2222222222222222, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.9355069850316178, "length_ratio": 0.9375, "translation_length": 45, "reference_length": 48}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8483275175094604, "bert_score_recall": 0.8564114570617676, "bert_score_f1": 0.8523502945899963}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 2.9913241863250732}
