{"sample_id": 536, "prompt": "Surrounded with rocky, sandy and five salt ranges, POKARAN means \u201cthe place", "reference": " of five mirages\u201d.Fort Pokaran stands on ancient trade route that carried salt, silk and spices to Persia and beyond. Instead of winding caravans of the past, it now has trains, buses and cars. The fort now attracts travellers to stay betwixt the glorious history where each stone speaks out volumes of the past.\nDoctor on Call, Swimming Pool, Travel Counter.", "generated_dual_stream": "of the mountains\u201d and is located in the central part of the United States.\nThe POKARAN value the most is the most attractive and beautiful views of the sky, but according to the American standard, it is the most expensive of the air", "generated_original": "of fish\u201d and it is known for its fishing. POKARAN, located on the shore of the Gulf of Riga, is a popular resort in the summer. It has a beautiful sandy beach and a promenade. There are many restaurants", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.24999999999999994, "rouge2": 0.0392156862745098, "rougeL": 0.1923076923076923, "rougeLsum": 0.1923076923076923}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.32608695652173914, 0.08888888888888889, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.5807248229785978, "length_ratio": 0.647887323943662, "translation_length": 46, "reference_length": 71}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8441945314407349, "bert_score_recall": 0.8200837969779968, "bert_score_f1": 0.8319645524024963}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.24, "rouge2": 0.020408163265306124, "rougeL": 0.18000000000000002, "rougeLsum": 0.18000000000000002}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.36363636363636365, 0.023255813953488372, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.5413786357843793, "length_ratio": 0.6197183098591549, "translation_length": 44, "reference_length": 71}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8597519397735596, "bert_score_recall": 0.8273749947547913, "bert_score_f1": 0.8432528376579285}, "original_model_loss_on