{"sample_id": 537, "prompt": "For 10+ years running, Planet O has been at the local music leader in the Omaha", "reference": " metro area. Sunday nights from 6 - 8 we hit you with two hours of nothing but Local and Regional music.\nIn a band? Are you an artist with new music? Want to be on Planet O? E-mail us at planeto@897theriver.com. No MP3's or Wave files, must be a link to current music, bio and shows.", "generated_dual_stream": "community. We host an annual music leading competition, a unique annual fundraiser, and a variety of other events throughout the year to support our music and community. Our annual fundraiser is also held in conjunction with the donor\u2019s day. We offer a variety of", "generated_original": "area. They have played in a variety of venues from house shows to theaters, to even the famous Bicentennial Park.\nThe band is a mix of musicians that have been playing music together for a while. They have had members come and go", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.25, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.1346153846153846, "rougeLsum": 0.1730769230769231}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.30612244897959184, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.6648703197043959, "length_ratio": 0.7101449275362319, "translation_length": 49, "reference_length": 69}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8228595852851868, "bert_score_recall": 0.7954192161560059, "bert_score_f1": 0.8089067339897156}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.23529411764705882, "rouge2": 0.02, "rougeL": 0.1372549019607843, "rougeLsum": 0.19607843137254904}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3191489361702128, 0.021739130434782608, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.6262002277532728, "length_ratio": 0.6811594202898551, "translation_length": 47, "reference_length": 69}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8349441289901733, "bert_score_recall": 0.8036582469940186, "bert_score_f1": 0.8190025091171265}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 3.3171329498291016}
{"sample_id": 538, "prompt": "The toymaker Hasbro reported weaker-than-expected earnings Monday, and the company\u2019s CEO", "reference": " pointed to the ongoing liquidation of Toys R Us stores in the U.S. as a cause. Toys R Us was one of Hasbro\u2019s largest customers, and it filed for bankruptcy in September.\nHere & Now\u2018s Robin Young learns more from USA Today\u2019s Charisse Jones (@charissejones).", "generated_dual_stream": "said he expects to be able to save money and time to improve the quality of the operations.\nThe company\u2019s earnings report, which showed an increase in earnings of $1 per share in 2019, said a decline in the earnings of $1", "generated_original": "apologized for the shortfall.\nShares of the maker of G.I. Joe and Transformers were down about 3 percent in premarket trading. The company also posted a 7 percent drop in revenue for the quarter ended June 30.\nHasbro\u2019s revenue", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.21978021978021978, "rouge2": 0.022471910112359546, "rougeL": 0.15384615384615388, "rougeLsum": 0.15384615384615388}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.23404255319148937, 0.021739130434782608, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.8434853325386421, "length_ratio": 0.8545454545454545, "translation_length": 47, "reference_length": 55}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8195107579231262, "bert_score_recall": 0.8075699806213379, "bert_score_f1": 0.8134965896606445}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.24719101123595508, "rouge2": 0.02298850574712644, "rougeL": 0.15730337078651688, "rougeLsum": 0.17977528089887637}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3333333333333333, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.8007374029168082, "length_ratio": 0.8181818181818182, "translation_length": 45, "reference_length": 55}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8347526788711548, "bert_score_recall": 0.8086415529251099, "bert_score_f1": 0.821489691734314}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 2.3435020446777344}
