{"sample_id": 547, "prompt": "Title inspired by the song by The Jezabels that I use for the introduction to my", "reference": " show. I plan to orient a discussion of a few of this week\u2019s stories around this theme. See Program Notes, below, for all the stories, etc., I plan to discuss.\nThe Subtle Art of Not Giving a F*ck HT Nadya, Aurora, others I can\u2019t remember!\nDuring the first hour today, we\u2019ll hear our interview with Hayley Mary, lead singer of Australian \u201cintensindie\u201d band, The Jezabels. We spoke with Hayley a couple days ago and we think you\u2019ll agree, the interview was more than we could have expected or hoped for!\nDuring the second hour we\u2019ll also discuss some of this week\u2019s top stories. See Program Notes, below, for all the stories, etc., we plan to discuss.", "generated_dual_stream": "book, \"The song which came to my heart\" (which you can download I love here). How to use it for the introduction of my book, \"The song which came to my heart\" (which you can download I love here). How", "generated_original": "songs.\nI am a self taught musician. I have been playing since I was a child. I started playing piano, guitar and bass guitar at an early age and started to play drums when I was about 12 years old. I started learning music", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.14723926380368096, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.09815950920245399, "rougeLsum": 0.11042944785276075}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2692307692307692, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.1771480897843865, "length_ratio": 0.36619718309859156, "translation_length": 52, "reference_length": 142}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8241432309150696, "bert_score_recall": 0.8046035766601562, "bert_score_f1": 0.8142562508583069}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.10778443113772455, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.08383233532934131, "rougeLsum": 0.09580838323353294}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2857142857142857, 0.020833333333333332, 0.0,