{"sample_id": 563, "prompt": "Just acquired the Olympus Tough TG-850 camera that takes great pictures and can be taken out in", "reference": " the rain and underwater up to 33 feet without being placed in a protective cover. Finally, a viable solution for those of us who want high quality and portability in one machine. I\u2019m still getting a hang of things, but so far admire the ease of use, super-wide lens for the camera\u2019s size, the crazy amount of light the lens lets in and how vivid and sharp the end result is. I really look forward to taking it out in the field.\nEnough talk, here are some experimental shots taken in different settings. Verdict: If you are in the market for a new camera, this is the one.", "generated_dual_stream": "any of the toughest conditions. Packed in the camera and maintained was the complete system, which is just a few months old. I don't know what else to expect. This is a great system to take a lot of pictures. The Olympus Tough", "generated_original": "the toughest conditions.\nI am looking for a good and easy way to edit the images. I'm new to this and am not sure where to start. I would like to edit the pictures in either the camera or using a PC. I am using", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.23225806451612907, "rouge2": 0.0392156862745098, "rougeL": 0.15483870967741936, "rougeLsum": 0.16774193548387098}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.4375, 0.0425531914893617, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.21852970296695812, "length_ratio": 0.39669421487603307, "translation_length": 48, "reference_length": 121}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8551146984100342, "bert_score_recall": 0.8350611925125122, "bert_score_f1": 0.8449690341949463}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.22929936305732485, "rouge2": 0.038709677419354833, "rougeL": 0.15286624203821655, "rougeLsum": 0.20382165605095542}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.40816326530612246, 0.041666666666666664, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.230066298993809, "l