{"sample_id": 565, "prompt": "Above you can find the charger that will work with your Samsung GX-1S.\nThe factories", "reference": " that we use to produce our Samsung GX-1S chargers in Shenzhen were selected after extensive quality tests comparing many of the major factories across China. Our products are tested to Australian electrical safety standards and are marked with the Australian C-Tick electrical safety mark, as found on products at retail stores in Australia.\nAll of our Samsung GX-1S chargers come with a 400 Day (13 Month) 100% Money Back Guarantee.", "generated_dual_stream": "page which is where you can find your Samsung GX-1S factory reset instructions. You can get the best Samsung GX-1S factory reset with the most reputable brands on the internet. The Samsung GX cannot only work with the best extension of the", "generated_original": "that we use to produce our Samsung GX-1S chargers in Shenzhen were selected after extensive quality tests comparing many of the major factories across China. Our products are tested to Australian electrical safety standards and are marked with the Australian C-Tick electrical", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.2051282051282051, "rouge2": 0.10434782608695652, "rougeL": 0.17094017094017092, "rougeLsum": 0.18803418803418803}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2727272727272727, 0.09302325581395349, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.4723665527410147, "length_ratio": 0.5714285714285714, "translation_length": 44, "reference_length": 77}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8620859980583191, "bert_score_recall": 0.8306722044944763, "bert_score_f1": 0.846087634563446}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.7521367521367521, "rouge2": 0.7478260869565216, "rougeL": 0.7521367521367521, "rougeLsum": 0.7521367521367521}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.4535282698073728, "precisions": [1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.4535282698073728, "length_ratio": 0.5584415584415584, "translation_length": 43, "reference_length": 77}, "bert_sc