{"sample_id": 575, "prompt": "The final piece of DLC has arrived.\nThe final piece of DLC for Final Fantasy XV, Episode", "reference": " Ardyn, is now available for PlayStation 4, Xbox One, and Steam, bringing the convoluted saga of magical boy bands and their sports cars to an end(?). The DLC episode retails for $9.99 USD. To ring in the occasion, Square Enix has released a launch trailer, showing the villainous Ardyn doing dastardly deeds. Check it out below.\nExhilarating, action-packed battles where players can utilize powerful new attack moves and skills unique to Ardyn, including the \"Rising Phantom\" and \"Dark Tornado\"\nThe ability to warp to high platforms or across nearby buildings by way of \"Phantasmal Leap\"\nStay tuned to RPGFan for more Final Fantasy news!", "generated_dual_stream": "1: \"A Chameleon\" has been released. This piece of DLC for the PlayStation 3 has already been released. This is a great deal of DLC for the PlayStation 4. This is a great deal of DLC for the PlayStation", "generated_original": "Duscae 2, is now available to download. The DLC, titled \u201cThe Far Side of the World\u201d is the follow-up to Episode Duscae\u2019s \u201cThe Far Side of the World,\u201d and is set in the world of E", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.20689655172413793, "rouge2": 0.013986013986013986, "rougeL": 0.13793103448275862, "rougeLsum": 0.16551724137931037}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.4444444444444444, 0.022727272727272728, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.16166609347698693, "length_ratio": 0.3543307086614173, "translation_length": 45, "reference_length": 127}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8591418266296387, "bert_score_recall": 0.8102369904518127, "bert_score_f1": 0.8339730501174927}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.23611111111111108, "rouge2": 0.056338028169014086, "rougeL": 0.18055555555555552, "rougeLsum": 0.19444444444444445}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.013369782937881543, "precisions": [0.4634146341463415, 0.15, 0.07692307692307693, 0.02631578947368421], "brevity_penalty": 0.12275546700138912, "length_ratio": 0.3228346456692913, "translation_length": 41, "reference_length": 127}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8535270690917969, "bert_score_recall": 0.8133350610733032, "bert_score_f1": 0.8329464793205261}, "original_model_loss_on_full_text": 2.792468547821045}
{"sample_id": 576, "prompt": "HomeNewsNEWS: Borders announce debut album, \u2018Purify\u2019!\nFollowing the recent news", "reference": " that they\u2019ve signed over to Long Branch Records, British metal outfit Borders have now confirmed the details surrounding their debut full-length record.\nThe album, titled \u2018Purify\u2019 will be released on May 10th 2019.\nYou can check out the cover artwork, full track listing, lead single \u2018731\u2019, and pre-order options below.\nYou can pre-order the album online now through the label\u2019s webstore (here), BandCamp (here), iTunes (here), Amazon (here), and Google Play (here).\nNEWS: Martyr Defiled confirm farewell UK tour for September 2018!\nNEWS: Rolo Tomassi, Martyr Defiled, and more join UK Tech-Fest 2017!\nNEWS: Leprous, Vildhjarta, and more join UK Tech-Fest 2019!\nNEWS: First wave of bands named for Deadbolt Festival 2017!", "generated_dual_stream": "that the label has signed up to 2x Grammy-nominated the Beatles\u2019 band, the Beatles\u2019 first album \u201cPurify\u201d was released to the public. This album was released in a series of various tracks from all the Beatles\u2019 most", "generated_original": "that Borders were planning to record a new album, the band have now confirmed that the album is on its way.\nThe album is called \u2018Purify\u2019 and will feature 12 tracks of atmospheric, melodic, experimental metal. The album will", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1910828025477707, "rouge2": 0.012903225806451613, "rougeL": 0.14012738853503184, "rougeLsum": 0.17834394904458598}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3333333333333333, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.06271022482807168, "length_ratio": 0.2653061224489796, "translation_length": 39, "reference_length": 147}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8600213527679443, "bert_score_recall": 0.8028988242149353, "bert_score_f1": 0.8304789662361145}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.24050632911392403, "rouge2": 0.05128205128205