{"sample_id": 652, "prompt": "In an attempt to give Turkey a contemplative and comfortable escape, Global Architectural Development (G", "reference": "AD) has developed a mixed-use high rise, residential development wrapped in green terraces. Dubbed the \"Agoras Project,\u201d this green oasis situated in the heart of the busy metropolis of Istanbul will house varied sized flats to appeal to various budgets and family types, a shopping mall, 14 cinemas, a fitness center, restaurants and numerous cafes and shops.\nIt will come loaded with green features like natural day lighting, solar power, green terraces and rainwater collection.", "generated_dual_stream": "lad I is a member of the photovoltaic energy efficiency) of these buildings is the aim of this article. The photovoltaic energy efficiency (PVC efficiency) of the building is the ultimate objective of this article. The photovoltaic energy", "generated_original": "AD) and the Ministry of Culture and Tourism (MoCT) have designed a new complex in Istanbul to serve as a center for cultural exchange and education. The building is located on a hillside that overlooks the Bosporus and the Bosph", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.12280701754385964, "rouge2": 0.01785714285714286, "rougeL": 0.12280701754385964, "rougeLsum": 0.12280701754385964}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.23255813953488372, 0.023809523809523808, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.34308829611759545, "length_ratio": 0.48314606741573035, "translation_length": 43, "reference_length": 89}, "bert_score_precision": 0.784949779510498, "bert_score_recall": 0.7947020530700684, "bert_score_f1": 0.7897957563400269}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.27586206896551724, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.15517241379310345, "rougeLsum": 0.1724137931034483}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.4090909090909091, 0.023255813953488372, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.3596128392644036, "length_ratio": 0.4943820224719101, "translation_length": 44, "