{"sample_id": 723, "prompt": "Pippa\u2019s been on a \u201cWORK\u201d trip to New York\u2026 and has met someone", "reference": " VERY interesting.\nAs you may have heard, Pippa has been on a \u201cWORK\u201d trip (honest) to New York to see Ed Sheeran and get locked in her own hotel room.\nBut she\u2019s been sending more clips over across the weekend and has a little surprise for Chris!\nClue: it\u2019s NOT Ed Sheeran. Watch the clip and find out.", "generated_dual_stream": "who has a very interesting in-depth understanding of what the goals and objectives of the documentary are. Our work has been on a \u201cWORK\u201d trip to New York\u2026 and has met someone who has a very interesting in-depth understanding of what the goals and", "generated_original": "from the show!\nI\u2019ve never been to the US before, but my friend has been here a few times and knows all the best spots for Pippa to visit. And, of course, she\u2019s a big fan of the show, so", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.3584905660377358, "rouge2": 0.19230769230769232, "rougeL": 0.30188679245283023, "rougeLsum": 0.33962264150943394}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.08964221060569644, "precisions": [0.37777777777777777, 0.18181818181818182, 0.09302325581395349, 0.07142857142857142], "brevity_penalty": 0.6133074684824951, "length_ratio": 0.6716417910447762, "translation_length": 45, "reference_length": 67}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8387924432754517, "bert_score_recall": 0.8375126123428345, "bert_score_f1": 0.8381520509719849}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.3137254901960784, "rouge2": 0.04, "rougeL": 0.1764705882352941, "rougeLsum": 0.23529411764705882}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.34782608695652173, 0.022222222222222223, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.6334832378691003, "length_ratio": 0.6865671641791045, "translation_length": 46, "reference_length": 67}, "bert_score_precision": 0.865780234336853, "bert_score_recall": 0.8440190553665161, "bert_score_f1": 0.8547611236572266}, "or