{"sample_id": 733, "prompt": "Funny fishing tshirt gift for fisherman with a Type A personality. The fishing t shirts design", "reference": ", would make a great gift for Father's Day, mens birthday or as an anniversary gift. Fish Face Logo is printed on the back collar. Comes in Sports Grey.\nFREE, fun and clever gift wrapping!\nShirt is 5.3 oz, preshrunk heavy cotton. Screen printed on Gildan a basic loose fit style cut. Check the Size Info page for shirt measurements. Will withstand hundreds of washes.\nThis fishing t shirt was designed for \"Type A\" fishermen or women. You know the type: they throw their custom fishing rod in the water if they loose that bass at the boats edge. Call their lures or boat by a four letter word after a few hours of fishing with no luck. I've also been told this shirt is a good repellant to avoid any contact with other humans when out in public!", "generated_dual_stream": "by the team of the authors.\nTo get the fishing t-shirts for sale for $10, click here. Here you can find out about the fishing t-shirts. Alternatively, you are welcome to win the fishing t-shirts. You can elect to win", "generated_original": "is a great way to make someone who loves fishing feel appreciated. This shirt is the best gift for a fisherman who loves fishing.", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.17391304347826086, "rouge2": 0.01098901098901099, "rougeL": 0.11956521739130437, "rougeLsum": 0.15217391304347827}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.44680851063829785, 0.021739130434782608, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.09628665646628232, "length_ratio": 0.29936305732484075, "translation_length": 47, "reference_length": 157}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8424550890922546, "bert_score_recall": 0.7967866063117981, "bert_score_f1": 0.8189847469329834}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.1696969696969697, "rouge2": 0.061349693251533735, "rougeL": 0.09696969696969697, "rougeLsum": 0.13333333333333333}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.61