{"sample_id": 735, "prompt": "Do you have the power to listen compassionately to someone who has just lost a loved one?", "reference": " Do you have the power to write notes to the sick and elderly? Do you have the power to cook a meal for a needy person? Do you have the power to pray for others?\nGod has given us talents \u201cfor use and improvement.\u201d Our first task is to discern our talents by considering our occupations, our hobbies and interests, the input of others, the needs of our community, and our passions. Gratitude for God\u2019s gifts should lead us to commit to using the talents that we discover.", "generated_dual_stream": "Do you have the ability to have empathy that motorhomes like a water, and this is truly is the perfect way to connect with us? Do you have the power to listen compassionately to someone who has just lost a loved one? Do you have", "generated_original": "If not, you can learn how by listening to the wisdom of the Dalai Lama and other spiritual leaders. The Dalai Lama has been a mentor to many people over the years. He is one of the world\u2019s most respected spiritual leaders and his", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.3582089552238806, "rouge2": 0.15151515151515152, "rougeL": 0.2388059701492537, "rougeLsum": 0.29850746268656714}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.08722881484240874, "precisions": [0.5625, 0.2765957446808511, 0.1956521739130435, 0.13333333333333333], "brevity_penalty": 0.3455907525769745, "length_ratio": 0.48484848484848486, "translation_length": 48, "reference_length": 99}, "bert_score_precision": 0.847905158996582, "bert_score_recall": 0.8369002342224121, "bert_score_f1": 0.8423667550086975}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.2537313432835821, "rouge2": 0.015151515151515154, "rougeL": 0.16417910447761194, "rougeLsum": 0.16417910447761194}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3829787234042553, 0.021739130434782608, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.3307531412348747, "length_ratio": 0.47474747474747475, "