{"sample_id": 745, "prompt": "If you know anything about the hottest music festivals in the country, you may have heard about L", "reference": "ollapalooza. In a 4 day spree, the biggest names in music take the stage to give festival goers an awesome musical experience. From August 1- 4, fans will make it to Grand Park, Chicago to be part of it all. This year, the festival will give us our favorite pop, hip hop, EDM and country sounds from headliners Ariana Grande, Childish Gambino, Twenty One Pilots, and The Strokes.\nEarlier this week, Lollapalooza gave fans a partial lineup through a 13-minute video that hinted at performances from Janelle Monae, Tame Impala, Rosalia, Lil Wayne, and J Balvin.\nFollowing the full announcement, fans can expect to see Meek Mill, Hozier, 21 Savage, H.E.R, Lil Baby, Gunna, Sheck Wes and so much more. Continue below to read the full list!", "generated_dual_stream": "ighthouse.\nIf you are a person who loves spending time with their friends, then it is definitely worth it to you. Lighthouse is located in the Clearwater, Florida area, which is situated on the Atlantic Ocean. The resort is famous for its", "generated_original": "ollapalooza. This year, the festival was held in Grant Park on July 31, 2015. The festival ran from 2 pm to 2 am on Sunday, July 31, 2015. This year,", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.09302325581395349, "rouge2": 0.011764705882352941, "rougeL": 0.06976744186046512, "rougeLsum": 0.058139534883720936}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2916666666666667, 0.02127659574468085, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.09301448921066349, "length_ratio": 0.2962962962962963, "translation_length": 48, "reference_length": 162}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8352331519126892, "bert_score_recall": 0.7767388224601746, "bert_score_f1": 0.8049246668815613}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.15, "rouge2": 0.0379746835443038, "rougeL": 0.11249999999999999, "rougeLsum": 0.125}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.006379124681657208, "