{"sample_id": 916, "prompt": "A solid, fully pressure treated picnic table which is quick and easy to assemble.\nSubstantial arch", "reference": ", ideal for seperating two areas of the garden. Covered with quality lattice panels to allow plant growth to climb.\nOur smallest arbour, made from fully pressure treated timber for long life. Slatted roof provides a good amount of shade.\nSides & rear are enclosed by square lattice panels to enable planting growth to climb and cover the seat if desired.\nRelaxing swing seat which has a solid roof to provide cover from the weather. Sides are part boarded, with square trellis above.\nThe gorgeous Burford Half Arbour has a unique, eye-catching design that can comfortably sit 3-4 people. Fully pressure treated for long life.\nPressure treated hexagonal gazebo with three solid back panels and two half board, half trellis front panels. Slatted wooden roof as standard.\nPressure treated hexagonal gazebo with three half boarded trellis panels and two balustrade and spindle panels. Pressure treated benches available.", "generated_dual_stream": "-racial inequality in the workplace that is kept hidden from the public.\nThe government is proposing to increase the cost of the workplace to \u00a3100 and a month, which is a huge chunk of the table. This is a huge chunk of the table,", "generated_original": "ing legs, with a unique design which is both attractive and strong.\nAll-weather, highly durable construction, with a choice of oak or redwood top.\nAll of our picnic tables are available in two sizes, 48\" x 48\"", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.15706806282722513, "rouge2": 0.021164021164021166, "rougeL": 0.09424083769633508, "rougeLsum": 0.15706806282722513}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3958333333333333, 0.06382978723404255, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.08557746127787037, "length_ratio": 0.2891566265060241, "translation_length": 48, "reference_length": 166}, "bert_score_precision": 0.8165998458862305, "