{"sample_id": 947, "prompt": "Posted on Sep 13 2018 - 9:18am by Robby S.\n", "reference": "The leaks and rumors were pretty accurate this year. Apple launched a handful of new phones packed with new technology and some new colors. Oh, and some awful naming conventions (XS, XR, and XS Max).\nThey also launched the Series 4 Watch with a 35% larger screen while both the 40 and 44mm are thinner. The backs of the watches are a thing of beauty and are made of sapphire crystal and black ceramic. Apple has also managed to add much more information (complications) the the face of the screen.\nThe Series 4 Watch has doubled down on health and fitness with proactive heart rate monitoring and a built-in electrocardiogram (ECG). This is the first wearable OTC ECG device to date.\nThe guts of the watch have been upgraded with an S4 system-on-chip, a new accelerometer for more accurate activity tracking, and a 64-bit dual-core processor that is twice as fast as the last generation. The microphone and speaker are improved as well and the digital crown now has haptic feedback. Lastly the old bands still work on the Series 4 Watch ($399-$499).", "generated_dual_stream": "Ireland's most famous tourist attraction, the Giant\u2019s Castle is a ruins of the longest kind. \u201cCheese caves, which are 90 mins from Dublin to the Castle, are widely regarded as the oldest one in Ireland,\u201d the Castle said.", "generated_original": "I am very pleased to share with you that the following 3 articles from my new book, The Gospel of the Kingdom: The Kingdom of God as the Lord\u2019s Prayer, have been published in three different languages on different websites. I am also pleased", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.11353711790393012, "rouge2": 0.017621145374449337, "rougeL": 0.09606986899563318, "rougeLsum": 0.10480349344978165}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.4, 0.045454545454545456, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.02338745396938461, "length_ratio": 0.2102803738317757, "tra