{"sample_id": 954, "prompt": "SEFCU The bank of tomorrow \u2013 Stereolize.\na showroom to display the bank", "reference": " branch of the future.\nand a multi-touch table that offered diverse ways of usage.\npresentation device for small groups of visitors.We hope that all banks will be like this in the future.\nthrough the processes common in a bank.\nand information that would be needed in a bank branch of the future.\nintuitively be retrieved though easily understandable touch menues.\nrange of financial products could be displayed on the wall or the table.\ncan be changed by the client through a web-based solution.", "generated_dual_stream": "'s products and services, the bank will allow you to check online banking. Stereolize the bank of tomorrow by clicking the \"free spins\" button.\nThis entry was posted in Uncategorized and tagged bank, bank of tomorrow, online. Bookmark the", "generated_original": "\u2019s new products and services.\nA three-dimensional display system to show the different features of the new products.\nA big screen to display the bank\u2019s new service offers.\nA bank\u2019s main business is to provide banking services to its customers, but this is", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.24000000000000002, "rouge2": 0.0, "rougeL": 0.144, "rougeLsum": 0.224}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.3617021276595745, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.37579052535493185, "length_ratio": 0.5053763440860215, "translation_length": 47, "reference_length": 93}, "bert_score_precision": 0.7841410040855408, "bert_score_recall": 0.8233669996261597, "bert_score_f1": 0.803275465965271}, "metrics_original": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.18181818181818182, "rouge2": 0.030769230769230767, "rougeL": 0.12121212121212122, "rougeLsum": 0.18181818181818182}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.0, "precisions": [0.2127659574468085, 0.021739130434782608, 0.0, 0.0], "brevity_penalty": 0.37579052535493185, "length_ratio": 0.5053763440860215, "translation_length": 47, "referenc