{"sample_id": 980, "prompt": "You can get 30% energy savings in offices up to 20,000 feet with new", "reference": " HVAC systems. Contact Us today about the latest high efficiency technology for your particular needs. Ask us how you can upgrade your building\u2019s HVAC system and take advantage of current Federal Tax Credits.\nUsing the best brands in the industry has bolstered our sales department over the competition. By installing quality, energy efficient, reliable equipment that provides the best comfort, we have grown our installation department. In addition, keeping an experienced team of professionals, we still provide the quality workmanship each job requires.\nWhether you need full or partial HVAC system replacement or greenfield installations, our experts at Bolster-DeHart, Inc. will deliver. We will install and/or design any type of heating, cooling or air filtration system that you require in your light commercial building. We also install high-efficiency and sustainable comfort systems designed to be the most cost-effective on the market and geared to our climate and your particular property. Call or contact us today to schedule an estimate!", "generated_dual_stream": "report from the Office of Energy. In addition, the report describes the use of energy-efficient lighting canopies, which means that the color of your organization\u2019s most important asset is mismatched with the market.\nAfter you read the report, you can provide", "generated_original": "lighting technologies\nA new technology that can help cut energy costs by up to 30% in offices up to 20,000 square feet is now available in the UK.\nThis new technology is called Energy Saving Lighting (ESL), and is a", "metrics_dual_stream": {"rouge": {"rouge1": 0.21256038647342995, "rouge2": 0.03902439024390244, "rougeL": 0.1352657004830918, "rougeLsum": 0.19323671497584538}, "bleu": {"bleu": 0.004805197394255459, "precisions": [0.5217391304347826, 0.1111111111111111, 0.045454545454545456, 0.0232558